('7985dd99-d4fb-43f2-b1a7-3e86c2405783', 'Directed Readings', 'HIST5060', 3.0, 'Supervised reading for individual students or small groups, the separate sections of the course being devoted to the several fields of study and examination.', 'GS', 'F'),
