('9cd52aa2-984b-47b6-a12c-b0063eaa5934', 'Major Problems in the Philosophy of Mind', 'PHIL6355', 3.0, 'This course focuses on one or more of the central problems in the philosophy of mind. Topics may include: the metaphysics of mind, mental causation, intentionality, belief, consciousness, qualia and propositional attitudes.', 'GS', 'F'),
