('69e9ca43-bda6-4bf0-8780-d94fd4b50a68', 'MA Major Research Paper', 'CDIS6001', 0.0, 'Prerequisites: GS/CDIS 5100 6.00, GS/CDIS 5110 3.00, GS/CDIS 5120 3.00, and two 3.00-credits elective courses at graduate level including one course being offered by the Critical Disability Studies graduate program.', 'GS', 'SU'),
