('5a1e452a-c085-4c6d-9599-1cc677cd4b1b', 'Graduate Seminar Series in Civil Engineering', 'CIVL6000', 0.0, 'The Graduate Seminar Series comprises at least twelve individual seminar events organized by the Department of Civil Engineering approximately once a month throughout the academic year and an annual conference-style all-day Graduate Symposium in which MASc and PhD students give presentations based on their respective research projects. Each MASc student is expected to give at least one presentation at the Graduate Symposium. Each PhD student is expected to give at least two presentations at the Graduate Symposium. All graduate students (MASC and PhD) are required to attend at least 10 graduate seminars during the course of their respective degree programs.', 'GS', 'SU'),
