('cf8ed1ce-119b-465e-91fa-7a57a61cdeed', 'Selected Topics in Research Methods', 'CMCT6922', 3.0, 'Develops knowledge and skills of selected advanced research methods topics. The list of topics for discussion is flexible, depending upon the interests and preparation of students from year to year and the specialty of the course director. Corequisite: CC8902 (CMCT 6002 3.0) or CC9900 (CMCT 7200 3.0)', 'GS', 'S1'),
