('b401b9b0-d578-467a-9236-d802eb7456fa', 'Work Placement in the Global Context', 'GBUS4100', 3.0, 'Work Placement in the Global Context provides undergraduate students with an opportunity to earn credit for gaining relevant work experience in a global context. Approval of work placement must be obtained by the undergraduate associate program director prior to start of the course. Course Credit Exclusion: IBUS 4100 3.00', 'SB', 'SU'),
